{"type":"Collection","id":"lunar_orbiter_laser_altimeter","stac_version":"1.0.0","description":"These data are Lunar Orbiter Laser Altimeter (LOLA) Reduced Data Record (RDR) spot observations stored in latitude, longitude, radius (km). All data in this collection were acquired from the Planetary Data System (PDS) LOLA RDR Query Tool, Version 2.0. The data have been converted from Comma Separated Value (CSV) to Cloud Optimized Point Cloud (COPC) file format for efficient query and download by tools such as the Point Data Abstraction Library (PDAL). Data are released in geographic coordinates (IAU moon sphere, center longitude 0, -180 - 180 longitude domain) and include the appropriate IAU Well-known Text v2 (WKT2).","links":[{"rel":"self","type":"application/json","href":"https://g6goyz4w56.execute-api.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/prod/collections/lunar_orbiter_laser_altimeter"},{"rel":"parent","type":"application/json","href":"https://g6goyz4w56.execute-api.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/prod"},{"rel":"root","type":"application/json","href":"https://g6goyz4w56.execute-api.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/prod"},{"rel":"items","type":"application/geo+json","href":"https://g6goyz4w56.execute-api.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/prod/collections/lunar_orbiter_laser_altimeter/items"},{"rel":"http://www.opengis.net/def/rel/ogc/1.0/queryables","type":"application/schema+json","href":"https://g6goyz4w56.execute-api.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/prod/collections/lunar_orbiter_laser_altimeter/queryables"},{"rel":"aggregate","type":"application/json","href":"https://g6goyz4w56.execute-api.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/prod/collections/lunar_orbiter_laser_altimeter/aggregate","method":"GET"},{"rel":"aggregations","type":"application/json","href":"https://g6goyz4w56.execute-api.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/prod/collections/lunar_orbiter_laser_altimeter/aggregations"}],"stac_extensions":["https://stac-extensions.github.io/projection/v1.0.0/schema.json","https://stac-extensions.github.io/pointcloud/v1.0.0/schema.json","https: